---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Support Bethany Fire
section: support
eyebrow: Support
heading: Support Bethany Fire
lead: We are volunteers. Your gift helps keep us ready.
description: "Donate to the Bethany Volunteer Fireman's Association, which operates the Bethany Volunteer Fire Department and Ambulance Corps."
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container split split--wide-left">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lead">Gifts go to the {{ site.legal.name }}, which operates the Bethany Volunteer Fire Department and the Ambulance Corps.
        {%- if site.legal.einVerified %} Our EIN is {{ site.legal.ein }}.{% endif %}</p>
      <h2>What your gift helps with</h2>
      {%- if impact.items.length %}
      <ul class="news-list">
        {%- for item in impact.items %}
        <li class="news-item"><h3>{{ item.title }}{% if item.amount %} <span class="badge">{{ item.amount }}</span>{% endif %}</h3><p>{{ item.text }}</p></li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
      {%- else %}
      <p>Your gift helps a volunteer department stay ready: equipment, training, and the apparatus we answer calls in.</p>
      {%- endif %}

      <h2>Other ways to give</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Monthly giving.</strong> Want to give a little every month? <a href="/contact/?topic=donations">Ask us how</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Gifts in honor or memory.</strong> <a href="/contact/?topic=donations">Contact us</a> to make a tribute gift.</li>
        <li><strong>By check.</strong> {% if site.donate.mailingAddress %}Make it out to the {{ site.legal.name }} and mail it to {{ site.donate.mailingAddress }}.{% else %}<a href="/contact/?topic=donations">Contact us</a> for our mailing address.{% endif %}</li>
        <li><strong>Local businesses.</strong> <a href="/sponsors/#become-a-sponsor">Become a sponsor</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <aside class="callout callout--red">
      <h3>Donate online</h3>
      {%- if site.donate.paypalHostedButtonId %}
      <form action="https://www.paypal.com/donate" method="post" target="_top">
        <input type="hidden" name="hosted_button_id" value="{{ site.donate.paypalHostedButtonId }}">
        <button class="btn btn--brass" type="submit">Donate with PayPal</button>
      </form>
      <p class="small muted">You will go to PayPal to finish your gift.</p>
      {%- else %}
      <p>Online giving is being reconnected. In the meantime, <a href="/contact/?topic=donations">contact us</a> to give.</p>
      {%- endif %}
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--deep">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <div class="section__head"><p class="eyebrow">Transparency</p><h2>Where the money goes</h2></div>
    {%- if transparency.documents.length %}
    <ul>
      {%- for d in transparency.documents %}<li><a href="{{ d.file }}">{{ d.title }}</a>{% if d.year %} ({{ d.year }}){% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- else %}
    <p>We will post our Form 990 and a short annual financial summary here.</p>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>
